  "title": "Nissan’s Manual-Equipped Z NISMO Starts Under $70K",
  "summary": "When we drove the six-speed manual-equipped 2027 Nissan Z NISMO earlier this year, we lauded Nissan for adding the row-your-own option to what was already a very engaging car. “Iteration complete,” was the succinct verdict passed down by managing editor Eddy Eckart. We did not, however, know what this stylish sports car would cost you. […]",
